i mereka kosong.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "مُهْطِعِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُقْنِعِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رُءُوسِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَرْتَدُّ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/27d4a39ae6edd30115aa.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(ne) vraća se", "en": "(does not) return", "tr": "geri dönmez", "fr": "(ne) revient (pas)", "id": "(tidak) kembali", "ur": "(نہیں) لوٹتا", "bn": "(সে) ফিরে যায় (না)", "fa": "بازنمی‌گردد"}}, {"text": "إِلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طَرْفُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَفْـِٔدَتُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَوَآءٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "18:64", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huma", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2204.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: This is that which we have been seeking. So they retraced their steps again.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Musa da demişti ki: \"İşte aradığımız o idi.\" Bunun üzerine izlerine dönüp gerisin geri gittiler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "موسیٰ نے کہا یہی تو ہم چاہتے تھے تو پیچھے پلٹے اپنے قدموں کے نشان دیکھتے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Musa berkata: \"Itulah (tempat) yang kita cari\". Lalu keduanya kembali, mengikuti jejak mereka semula.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": 